.TP
\f[I]ep\f[R]
The endpoint the operation is issued on.
.TP
\f[I]msg\f[R]
The operation\(cqs message descriptor, the same structure the
corresponding fi_*msg call takes: struct fi_msg for fi_sendmsg and
fi_recvmsg (see \f[CR]fi_msg\f[R](3)), struct fi_msg_tagged for
fi_tsendmsg and fi_trecvmsg (see \f[CR]fi_tagged\f[R](3)), struct
fi_msg_rma for fi_readmsg and fi_writemsg (see \f[CR]fi_rma\f[R](3)),
and struct fi_msg_atomic for the atomic calls (see
\f[CR]fi_atomic\f[R](3)).
.TP
\f[I]fetch\f[R]
The result buffers of a fetching or compare atomic operation, as passed
